      "description": "Selected project in the sidebar. Project navigation follows Library and on-page section links follow MCP guide. Marketplace ranking filters remain in the main content without duplicate sidebar controls.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-nav\" type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\">Portfolio website <span>3</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;gap:9px;text-align:left;padding:10px;border:0;border-radius:6px;min-height:44px;background:#dfe6f6;color:#1e429d;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav span{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-nav:hover{background:#e3e7ee}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#294fbd);outline-offset:3px}"
